.TH XD\-TASKBAR 1 2026-10-18 XeonDesktop "XeonDesktop Manual"
.SH NAME
xd\-taskbar \- Taskbar and Start Menu Properties
.SH SYNOPSIS
.SY xd\-taskbar
.RB [ "\-\-page 1" ]
.YS
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B xd\-taskbar
is Taskbar and Start Menu Properties (Control Panel > Taskbar and Start
Menu).
The Taskbar tab sets locking, auto-hide, keeping the taskbar on top,
grouping or combining task buttons, Quick Launch, showing the taskbar on
all displays, the clock and hiding inactive notification icons (with
Customize Notifications).
The Start Menu tab picks the Windows 2000, XP or Windows 7 Start menu and
customizes it.
.PP
Apply and OK write
.IR desktop.ini ,
which
.BR xd\-shell (1)
follows at once.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B "\-\-page 1"
Open on the Start Menu tab.
.TP
.BI \-\-style " style"
.TQ
.BI \-\-scheme " file"
The visual style and colour scheme instead of those in
.IR desktop.ini .
.SH FILES
.TP
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/xeondesktop/desktop.ini
.B [Taskbar]
and
.BR [StartMenu] .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR xd\-shell (1),
.BR xd\-control (1)
